x;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTkg9BIaBcK4jmlQXCialuqJNq0l79MXUpNnKk06KZ3bOGyEnEgwr2BYuxia1M4JWYX0IJVfibByT1DDQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 562px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n            钻石庄园主夫妇 Diego 和 Derlin\n           </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<p style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</o:p>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n           El Diante钻石庄园位于哥伦比亚慧兰的拉普拉特镇，海拔1950米，由Diego 和妻子 Derlin一起打理经营\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n           。\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</o:p>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: \"苹方 常规\";font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.533333px;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</o:p>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTkg9BIaBcK4jmlQXCialuqJNicUib3yFTaPDAKBXMWCtOArwKZa1vlVgo4oiaqmMsMibBltrpPzeUK20YA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n           钻石庄园主Diego在庄园\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<p style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</o:p>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n            Diego和Derlin都是哥伦比亚人，Derlin家里正是Finca Tamana；2021 年，Diego 成为第一位赢\n           </span>\n</o:p>\n</o:p>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n           得世界咖啡师大赛的哥伦比亚人，也是第一位实现从种子到杯子取得如此成绩的种植者，他的成功归功于他不仅是一名咖啡师，同时也是也是烘焙师和种植者的丰富经验。\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: \"苹方 常规\";font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTkg9BIaBcK4jmlQXCialuqJNqIkd6Vicyts52ZhGaibbAhKkRVjekagu9FfHvRq8wrV8nTpK2Mfeb4jQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n           Diego 和 咖篮哥伦比亚品控 Sandra\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<p style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n           Diego 和 Derlin 一直不断改进、完善他们的庄园种植和处理。年复一年，他们的辛勤工作和奉献精神得到了回报，我们明显感受到他们出品的咖啡变得越来越好。\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: \"苹方 常规\";font-size: 10.5pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;visibility: visible;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTkC1jX5eShQao1e0YZBG9dGkTcrNQHnvnKAPJnwPsCzJscIRO6oibpaIjBq6MM5VXGHz6q9ibVf5OicA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 564px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</o:p>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n           钻石庄园\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n           帕帕尤的咖啡果很有特色，形状细长，它的名字大概率来自于它形似木瓜果实。帕帕尤品种在慧兰省以外的地区非常罕见，人们对它如何出现在哥伦比亚知之甚少。它最初被认为是卡杜拉的突变，但世界咖啡研究中心的基因测序表明它与埃塞俄比亚的原生种有密切关系。这只Papayo蜜处理也是我们第一次喝到选到，相比去年短暂卖过的水洗，蜜处理更水果，也更甜美～骚瑞，这一只真的是太甜了，我不得不大力的赞美它！\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: \"苹方 常规\";visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTmwFOa3R3xbiaicBDeEia7hyACGu6y9NW4Aia7yCILClVh0CHAYjJMHkicaNTszW1NVWC6S2dPJwEVHgQQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 661px;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</o:p>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n            帕帕尤鲜果\n           </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;text-align: center;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n           更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;margin-right: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;text-align: center;'>\n<o:p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">